{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-25T09:02:31.621Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Implementation**\n- Added `src/core/report/report-dependencies.ts` with `collectDependencies` (reads every numbered task stream of active/archived changes for `dependencies_added` events, dedupes `{file, name}` pairs, sorts by file then name, returns `{change, added}` entries in change order), plus `addedPairs`, `distinctPairs`, and `formatDependencies`.\n- `src/core/report/report.ts`: `HistoryMetrics.dependencies?`, filled by `getMetricsReport` only when non-empty, and a `Dependencies added:` text section printed only when non-empty.\n- `src/cli/report.ts`: `toStableMetrics` copies `history.dependencies` only when non-empty, keeping `fixture/report/expected.json` byte-identical.\n- `src/core/status/show.ts`: `formatDependenciesAdded` beside `formatStuck`, emitted right after the `Instructions changed after approval:` line.\n- `README.md`: documented ADR `checks`/`denies`, the `adr_check_modified` flag, the dependency baseline/`dependencies_added`, `denied_dependency` with automatic retry, and the new show/report lines.\n- Added `tests/dependencies-report.test.ts` covering both requirements.\n\n**Verification**\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/dependencies-report.test.ts` → 6 pass.\n- `pnpm verify` → typechecks, build, full suite, and Biome lint all pass.\n\nThe one judgment call (flagged in the result file): dependency entries use the change folder name (`012-adds`, matching the delta scenario `012-<slug>`) and the `added` field name, since the task didn't pin the JSON identifier/shape.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/080-architecture-decision-checks/.run/results/4.md`."}}
